{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35606","headline":"松 · 李山甫","name":"松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地耸苍龙势抱云，天教青共衆材分。\n孤标百尺云中见，长啸一声风里闻。\n桃李傍他真是佞，藤萝攀尔亦非羣。\n平生相爱应相识，谁道修篁胜此君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「松」条，撰者秦岭梅、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"秦岭梅"}